From: mac-verify CI <mac-verify@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 14 Oct 2026 19:13:45 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] candle-kernels: take the 0.11.0 CUDA kernel crate into
 the workspace (unmodified copy)

candle-core pulled candle-kernels 0.11.0 from crates.io, so a kernel source problem could only be worked
around. The crate now lives in the workspace and candle-core depends on it by path. The copy is byte-identical
to the crates.io release (src/, build.rs, README.md, Cargo.toml); only candle-core is a dependent, in this
workspace and in the application's lock file, so there is still exactly one copy in a build.

- Cargo.toml: workspace member candle-kernels
- candle-core/Cargo.toml: candle-kernels gets path = "../candle-kernels"
- Cargo.lock: candle-kernels is a path package (registry source and checksum removed)
- NOTICE, candle-kernels/FORK-NOTES.md: origin, licence and where the changes are listed

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01GcxyAs2y3NUizfXh9YWmxx
